Data format
-----------

The `Data_AX` datasets under `figures/data/` and `data/` are Python pickles, and
the pretrained reward networks under `data/reference/reward_networks/` are
TensorFlow SavedModels. Both formats execute code on load. Load only copies you
obtained from this repository or from the archive it cites — including the
Keras `.h5` checkpoints a training run of your own writes under `results/`.
